 -   **IG API Proxy**: Full-featured proxy for IG Group Trading API covering ALL IG operations: positions (open/close/update), working orders (create/update/delete), market search, price history, watchlists, activity/transaction history, and session management. Handles authentication automatically with centralized session management (4-minute proactive token refresh). All bots and agents route through this single proxy session — bots via `http://localhost:5000/api/ig/...`, agents via `https://$REPLIT_DEV_DOMAIN/api/ig/...` (agents MUST use the public URL because `web_fetch` blocks localhost due to SSRF protection). Market data responses are cached for 30 seconds to prevent IG rate limit errors. See `skills/ig-trading/IG-COMMANDS.md` for complete endpoint reference. Includes a multi-layered trade proof reader for risk mitigation.
 -   **Independent Live Streaming**: Lightstreamer price streaming can connect independently to the live IG account for fast price data, completely decoupled from the active trading profile. Config page has Connect/Disconnect button with green status indicator. Endpoints: `POST /api/ig/stream/connect-live`, `POST /api/ig/stream/disconnect-live`, `GET /api/ig/stream/status` (includes `liveStreamingActive`, `streamingSource`, per-instrument stats, and performance `metrics` fields). Live streaming session has its own token refresh cycle.
 -   **Streaming Status Dashboard**: The IG Dashboard includes a collapsible Streaming Status section showing: updates/sec, average update interval, uptime, streaming source/endpoint, total update count, min/max interval range, and a per-instrument table (bid/offer/mid, market status, data age with color coding, update counts). The trading bot logs `[STREAM]` or `[REST]` next to each price evaluation to indicate the data source. Bot tries streaming prices first (via `GET /api/ig/stream/prices`) and falls back to REST API if unavailable.
+-   **Ultra-Fast Scalper Engine** (`skills/bots/ig-scalper-engine.cjs`): Event-driven scalping bot that hooks directly into the Lightstreamer `onItemUpdate` callback inside `ceo-proxy.cjs` for zero-latency price access. Reacts to every tick — no polling loop. Maintains rolling tick buffers per instrument and calculates micro-momentum. Reads higher-timeframe bias from `ig-alerts.json` (signal monitor). Bypasses the proof reader for speed. Risk controls: budget cap (max capital), max drawdown (auto-stop kill switch), max margin %, break-even buffer (min move > spread × buffer), max open positions, per-instrument cooldown. Tracks realized P&L, win/loss count, win rate. Trade log persisted in `ig-scalper-trades.json`. Config in `ig-scalper-config.json`. Auto-starts with Lightstreamer if `enabled: true`. Strategies support `direction: BOTH` for bi-directional scalping. API endpoints: `GET/PUT /api/ig/scalper`, `GET /api/ig/scalper/status`, `POST /api/ig/scalper/start|stop|reset`, `GET/POST /api/ig/scalper/strategies`, `PUT/DELETE /api/ig/scalper/strategies/:i`, `POST /api/ig/scalper/strategies/:i/toggle`. Dashboard section in `ig-dashboard.html` with 5-second refresh cycle for real-time P&L.
